flowchart LR
    callback[FreeGLUT 回呼<br/>滑鼠／鍵盤／畫面顯示]
    static[Window 靜態回呼]
    lookup[取得目前 GLUT 視窗 ID<br/>查找 Window]
    event[建立視窗或輸入 Event]
    routing[命中測試／焦點／滑鼠捕捉]
    dispatch[分派給 Element<br/>並沿父節點向上傳遞]

    callback --> static --> lookup --> event --> routing --> dispatch

